{"values": [{"comment_count": 1, "task_count": 0, "type": "pullrequest", "id": 1100, "title": "[ARC-3471] Add analytics around feature flags", "description": "### What is this?\n\nNew analytics events and attributes for feature flag interactions\n\n* We now emit events on FF client initialization and failure\n* We persist anonymous ID from `vscode` for analytics even after authentication\n* `Authenticate` button presses now report if they happened in local or remote env:\n\n![](https://bitbucket.org/repo/BgzgjpR/images/461711928-image.png)\n### How was this tested\n\n```\nnpm run lint\nnpm run test\nnpm run compile\n# poked around with things\n```\n\n‌", "state": "MERGED", "draft": false, "merge_commit": {"hash": "6b9766a08b27", "links": {"self": {"href": "https://api.bitbucket.org/2.0/repositories/atlassianlabs/atlascode/commit/6b9766a08b27"}, "html": {"href": "https://bitbucket.org/atlassianlabs/atlascode/commits/6b9766a08b27"}}, "type": "commit"}, "close_source_branch": true, "closed_by": {"display_name": "Stan Dzhumaev", "links": {"self": {"href": "https://api.bitbucket.org/2.0/users/%7Bd687d6b2-7655-4da6-8c9f-a261b8233766%7D"}, "avatar": {"href": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/SD-3.png"}, "html": {"href": "https://bitbucket.org/%7Bd687d6b2-7655-4da6-8c9f-a261b8233766%7D/"}}, "type": "user", "uuid": "{d687d6b2-7655-4da6-8c9f-a261b8233766}", "account_id": "712020:caba1b1d-131c-4274-bd00-4d652d289fb8", "nickname": "Stan Dzhumaev"}, "author": {"display_name": "Stan Dzhumaev", "links": {"self": {"href": "https://api.bitbucket.org/2.0/users/%7Bd687d6b2-7655-4da6-8c9f-a261b8233766%7D"}, "avatar": {"href": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/initials/SD-3.png"}, "html": {"href": "https://bitbucket.org/%7Bd687d6b2-7655-4da6-8c9f-a261b8233766%7D/"}}, "type": "user", "uuid": "{d687d6b2-7655-4da6-8c9f-a261b8233766}", "account_id": "712020:caba1b1d-131c-4274-bd00-4d652d289fb8", "nickname": "