abs/atlascode/pullrequests/1053/decline"}, "statuses": {"href": "https://api.bitbucket.org/2.0/repositories/atlassianlabs/atlascode/pullrequests/1053/statuses"}, "mergeability_checks": {"href": "https://api.bitbucket.org/2.0/repositories/atlassianlabs/atlascode/pullrequests/1053/mergeability/checks"}}, "summary": {"type": "rendered", "raw": "According to the Bitbucket pipeline configuration reference [https://support.atlassian.com/bitbucket-cloud/docs/parallel-step-options/#Parallel](https://support.atlassian.com/bitbucket-cloud/docs/parallel-step-options/#Parallel){: data-inline-card='' } there are two child properties/options on `parallel` property:\n\n* steps\n* fail-fast\n\nThese are now added to pipeline schema in addition to array of `step` properties.\n\nValidation tool [https://bitbucket-pipelines.atlassian.io/validator](https://bitbucket-pipelines.atlassian.io/validator) was used to test these cases:\n\n```\npipelines:\n  pull-requests:\n    '**':\n      - parallel:\n        fail-fast: true\n        steps:\n          - step:\n          ...\n```\n\n```\npipelines:\n  pull-requests:\n    '**':\n      - step:\n      ...\n```\n\n```\npipelines:\n  pull-requests:\n    '**':\n      - parallel:\n        - step:\n        ...\n```\n\n‌", "markup": "markdown", "html": "<p>According to the Bitbucket pipeline configuration reference <a data-inline-card=\"\" data-is-external-link=\"true\" href=\"https://support.atlassian.com/bitbucket-cloud/docs/parallel-step-options/#Parallel\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://support.atlassian.com/bitbucket-cloud/docs/parallel-step-options/#Parallel</a> there are two child properties/options on <code>parallel</code> property:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>steps</li>\n<li>fail-fast</li>\n</ul>\n<p>These are now added to pipeline schema in addition to array of <code>step</code> properties.</p>\n<p>Validation tool <a data-is-external-link=\"true\" href=\"https://bitbucket-pipelines.atlassian.io/validator\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bitbucket-pipelines.atlassian.io/validator</a> was used to test these cases:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">pipelines</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"n\">pull</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">requests</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"s1\">&#39;**&#39;</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n      <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">parallel</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">fail</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">fast</span><span class=\"o\">:</span> <span class=\"kc\">true</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">steps</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n          <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n          <span class=\"o\">...</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<div class=\"codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">pipelines</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"n\">pull</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">requests</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"s1\">&#39;**&#39;</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n      <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n      <span class=\"o\">...</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<div class=\"codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">pipelines</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"n\">pull</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">requests</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"s1\">&#39;**&#39;</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n      <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">parallel</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">step</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"o\">...</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n\n<p>‌</p>"}, "queued": false}, {"comment_count": 4, "task_count": 0, "type": "pullrequest", "id": 1081, "title": "Added default and allowed-values to pipeline schema of variables", "de